   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MGT103 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.3</span>\n<h2>The 7 course learning outcomes (CLO), verbatim</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Exam questions are written against these outcomes — use them as your checklist.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 14193 · Decision 377/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 09/04/2026 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MGT103 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.3</span>\n<h2>7 chuẩn đầu ra môn học (CLO), nguyên văn</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đề thi được ra theo các chuẩn đầu ra này — dùng chúng làm danh sách tự kiểm.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 14193 · QĐ 377/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 09/04/2026 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>CLO</th><th>Details (verbatim)<br><small>Nội dung (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>CLO1</strong></td><td>Define management, its functions including planning, decision-making, and strategy development processes, and influence of organizational environments.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>CLO2</strong></td><td>Describe the basic elements of organization design, encompassing forms, key situational influences, and components involved in designing effective operations systems.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>CLO3</strong></td><td>Discuss human resource management practices, including recruitment, development, motivation, and leadership strategies, within the context of environmental factors.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>CLO4</strong></td><td>Identify different types of organizational control mechanisms and analyze their characteristics to determine effectiveness in achieving organizational objectives.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>CLO5</strong></td><td>Apply the knowledge and understanding gained from the course to evaluate real-life management situations/dilemma and practices in both local and global business contexts.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>CLO6</strong></td><td>Develop leadership and management potential through the integration of theoretical knowledge with practical skills and self-awareness.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>CLO7</strong></td><td>Understand the ethical and social responsibility issues in real-life management situations.</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14193\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14193</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14193\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14193</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
